00:13:38,180 --> 00:13:39,980
Hey, what's the deal, Merrick?

252
00:13:40,740 --> 00:13:41,681
That's not good.

253
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:46,437
Merrick's Swords of Revealing Light traps
Joey's monsters for three whole turns.

254
00:13:46,520 --> 00:13:49,180
But Joey can still win, right? I hope so.

255
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:52,100
But not attacking for
three turns won't help.

256
00:13:52,460 --> 00:13:56,977
That's true, Mai, but Joey can still sacrifice
his monsters to summon stronger ones,

257
00:13:57,060 --> 00:13:59,157
and although his Jinzo can't attack,

258
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:01,711
its special ability does remain in effect.

259
00:14:01,860 --> 00:14:04,980
That means Merrick still
can't use his trap cards.

260
00:14:05,380 --> 00:14:06,560
Make your move.

261
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:08,190
Gladly.

262
00:14:08,360 --> 00:14:09,440
There it goes.

263
00:14:09,980 --> 00:14:13,098
I may not be able to attack,
but I can still do this.

264
00:14:13,300 --> 00:14:17,594
I sacrifice my battle warrior in order
to summon the legendary fisherman.

265
00:14:21,560 --> 00:14:26,017
You know how much this card meant to you,
Mako, and I promised you I'd use it well.

266
00:14:26,100 --> 00:14:31,020
And before I end my turn, I'll switch
all three of my monsters to defense mode.

267
00:14:32,040 --> 00:14:33,200
Prepare to lose.

268
00:14:36,180 --> 00:14:37,040
What's this?

269
00:14:37,740 --> 00:14:40,280
Why do you seem so shocked, Odeon?

270
00:14:40,460 --> 00:14:44,540
If you're posing as me, you should
have my card in your deck, right?

271
00:14:44,760 --> 00:14:47,289
That's why I slipped
it in before the duel.

272
00:14:47,400 --> 00:14:48,230
But Master,

273
00:14:48,313 --> 00:14:52,620
this card is too dangerous, and I'm
not meant to control its great power.

274
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:55,353
You can't possibly expect me to play it.

275
00:14:55,540 --> 00:14:56,700
Please reconsider.

276
00:14:57,060 --> 00:14:58,500
I beg of you.

277
00:14:58,700 --> 00:14:59,900
Stop whimpering.

278
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:01,400
You sound pitiful.

279
00:15:01,660 --> 00:15:03,757
I command you to play that card.

280
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:06,317
It's the only way to win this duel.

281
00:15:06,400 --> 00:15:10,040
You must place it within the
ancient ark on the temple steps,

282
00:15:10,140 --> 00:15:11,728
and when the time is right,

283
00:15:11,880 --> 00:15:13,409
you will release its rage.

284
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:16,397
Hey, Marek, I'm getting
tired of waiting around.

285
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:19,951
First, I'll place this card
face down on the playing field.

286
00:15:21,280 --> 00:15:23,740
Now prepare yourself, Mr.

287
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:29,780
Wheeler, for the next card I play will be
the final instrument of your destruction.

288
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:35,217
Do it,

289
00:15:35,300 --> 00:15:41,337
Odeon Play the card I added to your deck
right now As soon as you place it within

290
00:15:41,420 --> 00:15:44,137
the sacred arc on the temple steps You'll

291
00:15:44,220 --> 00:15:47,540
be invincible And if
you refuse to play it,

292
00:15:47,680 --> 00:15:51,160
you'll have to answer to
me The choice is yours,

293
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:57,580
Odeon Don't be a fool I must obey,
Master Merrick It is my sworn duty

294
00:15:58,460 --> 00:16:00,977
Something strange is
going on up there, guys.

295
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:02,057
Check out Merrick.

296
00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:03,737
He looks really freaked out.

297
00:16:03,820 --> 00:16:05,220
I think Taya's right.

298
00:16:05,760 --> 00:16:09,936
Ever since Merrick drew his last
card, he's been acting really strange.

299
00:16:10,220 --> 00:16:14,257
I wonder if it has something to do
with that ancient temple behind him.

300
00:16:14,340 --> 00:16:16,477
When he first played Temple of the Kings,

301
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:19,997
I had a bad feeling about that
box at the top of the stairs,

302
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:22,440
the one with the Egyptian symbols on it.

303
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:23,920
What could it be?

304
00:16:24,260 --> 00:16:26,997
For some weird reason,
it seems familiar to me,

305
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:30,940
But I'm not sure why Be careful, Joey Man,

306
00:16:31,040 --> 00:16:33,477
this is like the longest
move in history Good

307
00:16:33,560 --> 00:16:36,148
moves take time But how
would you know that?

308
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:40,900
And now, I seal this card In
the sacred Ark of the Temple

309
00:16:42,100 --> 00:16:47,017
Whoop-dee-doo You have no idea What
I've just done by securing this All

310
00:16:47,100 --> 00:16:51,700
-powerful card within my ancient sanctuary
By sealing this Card of the Gods,

311
00:16:51,900 --> 00:16:57,560
I have also sealed Your fate Card
of the Gods That ends my turn.

312
00:16:57,860 --> 00:16:59,720
A wise move, Odeon.

313
00:17:00,060 --> 00:17:01,220
Here I go!

314
00:17:01,420 --> 00:17:05,361
Time to bring back a monster from
my graveyard with Monster Reborn!

315
00:17:06,860 --> 00:17:09,640
Bring back my alligator's sword!

316
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:14,940
And now,

317
00:17:15,120 --> 00:17:21,000
I sacrifice my alligator's sword and my
swordsman of Landstar so I can summon this!

318
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:22,480
My insect queen!

319
00:17:31,820 --> 00:17:36,180
I won this card from a feisty
little germ named Weevil Underwood.

320
00:17:37,840 --> 00:17:41,397
Every one of my Battle City
victories is paying off right now.

321
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:44,127
Those duels got me three
incredible monsters.

322
00:17:45,820 --> 00:17:48,720
My tournament's done
wonders for Wheeler's deck.

323
00:17:49,080 --> 00:17:50,040
Look at that.

324
00:17:50,300 --> 00:17:54,457
Joey was able to summon every rare monster
he won in the tournament all at once.

325
00:17:54,540 --> 00:17:59,364
Yes, Joey has come a long way as a duelist
since the Battle City Tournament began,

326
00:17:59,460 --> 00:18:00,290
Mai.

327
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:01,440
Look out, Maric,

328
00:18:01,560 --> 00:18:04,957
because your Swords of Revealing
Light will lose their power next turn.

329
00:18:05,040 --> 00:18:08,777
And when those lights go out, there'll
be nothing holding my monsters back.

330
00:18:08,860 --> 00:18:12,331
And since you have nothing to
protect you, you're finished.

331
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:14,677
You think just because you were able to

332
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:17,584
acquire a few strong
monsters you can defeat me?

333
00:18:17,900 --> 00:18:22,977
You're so naive, for I am about to
summon a beast that you can't destroy.

334
00:18:23,060 --> 00:18:24,140
What?

335
00:18:24,920 --> 00:18:28,744
While your monsters were trapped
in my swords of revealing light,

336
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:32,540
I was able to prepare for the
arrival of my ancient creature.

337
00:18:33,020 --> 00:18:35,837
And this all-powerful entity will serve as

338
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:38,685
the guardian of the sacred
Temple of the Kings,

339
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:43,056
protecting my ancient sanctuary and
all of the secrets that lie within.

340
00:18:43,460 --> 00:18:45,400
Say that again with small words.

341
00:18:45,580 --> 00:18:46,500
You can't win.

342
00:18:46,760 --> 00:18:48,100
Once I play this,

343
00:18:48,640 --> 00:18:50,020
Cop of Sealed Souls.

344
00:18:50,360 --> 00:18:52,397
Then I reveal my face-down card.

345
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:53,980
Seal of Circuit!

346
00:18:54,540 --> 00:18:58,517
When these two magic cards are played
along with Temple of the Kings,

347
00:18:58,600 --> 00:19:02,217
they are able to awaken a great
creature from its ancient slumber.

348
00:19:02,300 --> 00:19:05,520
A being like none you've ever seen before!

349
00:19:06,460 --> 00:19:08,400
What is he? Patience!

350
00:19:08,660 --> 00:19:10,131
You're about to find out!

351
00:19:10,300 --> 00:19:12,888
Please hear my call,
Guardian of the Temple!

352
00:19:14,340 --> 00:19:15,170
Now!

353
00:19:15,253 --> 00:19:17,900
Mystical Beast of Circuit, I summon thee!

354
00:19:19,600 --> 00:19:22,280
I got a bad feeling about this, you guys!

355
00:19:29,480 --> 00:19:31,020
That thing's tremendous.

356
00:19:31,380 --> 00:19:32,674
What am I going to do?

357
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:38,980
That creature is minute compared to
what lurks within my sacred temple.

358
00:19:39,140 --> 00:19:43,560
Then tell me, now, what monster did
you hide inside that ark, Marek?

359
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:49,337
Within the sacred ark lies my Egyptian
god guard, the winged dragon of Ra!

360
00:19:49,420 --> 00:19:53,580
With that thing outside and
his Egyptian god caught inside,

361
00:19:53,940 --> 00:19:55,411
there's no way I can win!
